
@startuml

title Sequence Diagram 1 - Room Search, Reservation and Payment

autonumber

actor Guest
boundary "Hotel Application" as UI
control "HotelFacade" as Facade
control "RoomAvailabilityService" as Availability
control "PricingPolicy" as Pricing
participant "PricingStrategy" as Strategy
participant "RoomStayCharge" as BaseCharge
participant "ServiceDecorator" as Decorator
control "ReservationService" as ReservationService
entity "Reservation" as Reservation
participant "PendingState" as Pending
control "PaymentService" as PaymentService
participant "PayFlowGatewayAdapter" as Adapter
participant "PayFlowGateway" as Gateway
control "ReservationEventPublisher" as Publisher
participant "EmailNotifier" as Email
participant "SmsNotifier" as SMS
participant "AuditLogObserver" as Audit

== Search for Available Rooms ==

Guest -> UI: Enter check-in and check-out dates
UI -> Facade: searchRooms(checkIn, checkOut)
Facade -> Availability: searchAvailableRooms(checkIn, checkOut)

Availability -> Availability: Check room availability
Availability -> Availability: Check overlapping reservations

alt Available rooms found
    Availability --> Facade: Return available rooms
    Facade --> UI: Display available rooms
    UI --> Guest: Show available rooms and prices
else No available rooms
    Availability --> Facade: Return empty list
    Facade --> UI: No rooms available
    UI --> Guest: Display unavailable message
end

== Select Room and Calculate Price ==

Guest -> UI: Select room and additional services
UI -> Facade: bookRoom(guest, room)

Facade -> Availability: isRoomAvailable(room)

alt Room is still available

    Availability --> Facade: true

    Facade -> Pricing: calculatePrice(reservation)
    Pricing -> Strategy: calculatePrice(reservation)
    Strategy --> Pricing: Return base room price
    Pricing --> Facade: Return calculated room price

    Facade -> BaseCharge: Create room stay charge
    BaseCharge --> Facade: Return Chargeable object

    opt Guest selects breakfast
        Facade -> Decorator: Wrap charge with BreakfastService
        Decorator --> Facade: Updated Chargeable object
    end

    opt Guest selects spa package
        Facade -> Decorator: Wrap charge with SpaPackage
        Decorator --> Facade: Updated Chargeable object
    end

    opt Guest selects airport transfer
        Facade -> Decorator: Wrap charge with AirportTransfer
        Decorator --> Facade: Updated Chargeable object
    end

    Facade -> Decorator: getCost()
    Decorator --> Facade: Return total cost

    == Create Reservation ==

    Facade -> ReservationService: createReservation(guest, room)
    ReservationService -> Availability: Check availability again
    Availability --> ReservationService: Room available

    ReservationService -> Reservation: Create reservation
    Reservation -> Pending: Set initial state
    Pending --> Reservation: Reservation pending

    Reservation --> ReservationService: Return reservation
    ReservationService --> Facade: Return reservation

    == Process Payment ==

    Facade -> PaymentService: makePayment(reservation)
    PaymentService -> Adapter: processPayment(amount)
    Adapter -> Adapter: Convert amount to cents
    Adapter -> Gateway: makeTransaction(amountInCents)
    Gateway --> Adapter: Return transaction status

    alt Payment successful

        Adapter --> PaymentService: Payment successful
        PaymentService -> PaymentService: Create Payment (SUCCESS)
        PaymentService --> Facade: Return successful payment

        == Confirm Reservation ==

        Facade -> Reservation: confirm()
        Reservation -> Pending: confirm(reservation)
        Pending -> Reservation: setState(ConfirmedState)
        Reservation --> Facade: Reservation confirmed

        == Send Notifications ==

        Facade -> Publisher: notifyObservers(reservation, "CONFIRMED")

        Publisher -> Email: update(reservation, event)
        Email -> Email: sendEmail()
        Email --> Publisher: Email sent

        Publisher -> SMS: update(reservation, event)
        SMS -> SMS: sendSms()
        SMS --> Publisher: SMS sent

        Publisher -> Audit: update(reservation, event)
        Audit -> Audit: recordEvent()
        Audit --> Publisher: Event recorded

        Publisher --> Facade: Notifications completed

        Facade --> UI: Return booking confirmation
        UI --> Guest: Display confirmation and payment details

    else Payment failed

        Adapter --> PaymentService: Payment failed
        PaymentService --> Facade: Payment unsuccessful
        Facade --> UI: Display payment failure
        UI --> Guest: Show payment error

    end

else Room is no longer available

    Availability --> Facade: false
    Facade --> UI: Booking rejected
    UI --> Guest: Ask guest to select another room

end

@enduml
